{
  "name": "Lab Orders",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lab Orders — órdenes de laboratorio\n\nPOST /lab-orders/search        body = filtros (ver lab_orders_search en el script 148) → [{ row_data, total_count }]\nGET  /lab-orders/detail?id=    → [{ detail }] (orden + history)\nPOST /lab-orders/save          body = orden (sin id = alta: entra en la etapa inicial) → fila de v_lab_orders\nPOST /lab-orders/change-stage  { id, to_stage_id, expected_from_stage_id?, note? } → fila de v_lab_orders\nPOST /lab-orders/delete        { id } → baja lógica (is_deleted)\n\nLas funciones lanzan 'LAB_ORDERS:<CODIGO>'. 'Map error' responde 400 { success:false, code, message } y el frontend traduce code.\nEl usuario sale del JWT (jwtPayload.userId).\n\nRequiere database/scripts/147 y 148.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 640
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        -520
      ],
      "id": "33871723-28fb-4322-9ba6-30d5da64234e",
      "name": "Flow Documentation"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Las funciones del script 148 lanzan 'LAB_ORDERS:<CODIGO>'. Cualquier otro\n// error (conexión, constraint inesperada) sale como UNKNOWN con el mensaje crudo.\nconst raw = $json.error?.message ?? $json.error ?? $json.message ?? '';\nconst text = String(raw);\nconst match = text.match(/LAB_ORDERS:([A-Z_]+)/);\nreturn [{ json: {\n  success: false,\n  code: match ? match[1] : 'UNKNOWN',\n  message: text || 'Error',\n} }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        820
      ],
      "id": "7020c2a8-a803-4324-bb46-90c1b0d8fe10",
      "name": "Map error"
    },
